1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.
我是你的中国旅游专家

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,900
Beijing hides one straight line: 7.8 km.
北京藏着一条7.8公里直线

3
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:06,200
The whole capital was built around it.
整座都城依它而建

4
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,600
It's the Central Axis, from the 13th century.
这是13世纪的中轴线

5
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:10,900
Older than the Forbidden City itself.
比故宫还要早

6
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:13,300
South gate Yongdingmen to the Bell Tower.
南起永定门，北到钟楼

7
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,600
Double-tap if you'd walk all 7.8 km.
想走完全程的点个赞

8
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:18,000
UNESCO crowned it in July 2024.
2024年7月列入世界遗产

9
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,300
Fifteen monuments, threaded on one line.
十五处古迹，一线串起

10
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:22,600
Beijingers call a view this grand changliang.
北京话叫"敞亮"

11
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:25,100
★ Expert Tip: climb Jingshan for the full view.
登景山，一眼看全轴

12
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,500
Next stop: Yongdingmen. Where would you start?
下一站永定门·你从哪站起？
